06-08 19:32:51.814  9991  9991 D Client  : addStudent : name = James, age = 7, grade = 2
06-08 19:32:51.815 10005 10016 D AIDLService: call addStudent(), student list is :[name = John, age = 6, grade = 1, name = James, age = 7, grade = 2]

